  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>54</mn></msqrt><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>216</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>54</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Also&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>54</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Hence&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>54</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>54</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mi>i</mi></math> or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>6</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Hence, imaginary part <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></math></p>"
